      "body": "Scope note for the Gemini review: this PR intentionally fixes only the background flag loss from #27231.\n\nThe other fields mentioned by the bot are covered separately so that each PR stays reviewable:\n- require_reasoning and routing_key: #27199\n- multimodal controls and mm_hashes: #27259\n- session_params indexing: #27257\n\nKeeping background isolated also matches the issue impact: Responses API background jobs can be aborted incorrectly when __getitem__ resets background to false.",
