    {
      "body": "Re-checked against current main today: `GenerateReqInput.__getitem__` still reconstructs the sub-request without `background` (the field exists on the class; it is just not forwarded in the slice), so a batch with `background=True` silently turns into foreground sub-requests and the responses API never sees the flag. The one-line forward plus the batch regression test still apply cleanly. Happy to rebase if a maintainer confirms the slice should forward it.\n",
      "created_at": "2026-09-11T13:57:18Z",
