    },
    {
      "body": "Re-verified on current main (93809202a3): `GenerateReqInput.__getitem__` still rebuilds the per-sample request field by field and `background` is still not among the copied fields, so an `n > 1` background batch still falls back to foreground disconnect handling on slice (#27231). Four months in the queue; could a maintainer add the run-ci label? The fix is one field plus a regression test.\n",
